      showPopup('Reading the polar plot', 'Each spoke is one direction θ; its length is the radiance L arriving from that direction and its colour is the surface it comes from. In open air the plot is a full ring; inside the camera it collapses to a narrow spike — the pinhole has zeroed out almost the entire function.');
